    "A deadline is required. Calendar access is optional and lets you choose a calendar and avoid duplicate events. Deadline changes update the linked event. Removing the deadline or deleting a task keeps its event.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A deadline is required. Calendar access is optional and lets you choose a calendar and avoid duplicate events. Deadline changes update the linked event. Removing the deadline or deleting a task keeps its event."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "É preciso definir um prazo. O acesso ao Calendário é opcional e permite escolher um calendário e evitar eventos duplicados. Alterar o prazo atualiza o evento vinculado. Remover o prazo ou excluir a tarefa mantém o evento."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
